<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange</p>
<p>closed lower in active trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 39.66 to 6477.35.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.97 to 394.40.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.10.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1516 to 894.</p>
<p>Volume was 495,468,750 compared with 478,126,600 on Wednesday.</p>
